L001095		 $A(x)$ of the planar family (P). The solid blocks on the diagonals
L001096		 determine the function spaces of CY3 (blue), K3 (orange), and
L001097		 polylogarithmic (green) type.
L001098		 The off-diagonal entries are in corresponding lighter colours.
