L001339	\sec{Function space}
L001340	The final function space includes the K3 period
L001341	$\varpi_\text{K3}(x)$, its derivative $\varpi'_\text{K3}(x)$, and up to three times iterated integrals
L001342	\begin{align}\label{IIdef}
L001343	  \mathcal I [\varphi_1,...,\varphi_n;x]=\int_1^x \mathrm dx’\,\varphi_1(x')\,\mathcal{I}[\varphi_2,...,\varphi_n;x’] \, ,
L001344	\end{align}
L001345	where the integration kernels $\varphi_i(x)$ are selected from the set
L001346	\begin{align}
L001347		\bigg\{ &\dfrac{1}{x}, \dfrac{1}{1+x^2}, \dfrac{1+x}{x(x-1)}, \dfrac{-1+x}{x(x+1)}, \dfrac{1-x^2}{x+x^2+x^3}, \dfrac{1-x^2}{x-x^2+x^3}, \nonumber \\
L001348		&\quad \dfrac{-1+x^2}{x+x^3}, \dfrac{(1+x^2)\,\varpi_\text{K3}(x)}{x}, \dfrac{1}{x \,r(x)\,\varpi_\text{K3}(x)}\bigg\}
L001349	\end{align}
L001350	with the square root $r(x) = \sqrt{-1+34x^2-x^4}$. The normalised K3 period is chosen to have an even velocity expansion $(1+x^2) \varpi_\text{K3}(x) =1+\frac{15 v^2}{32}+\frac{351 v^4}{1024}+\mathcal O(v^6)$.
L001351	Even though we encounter CY3 varieties in the DEs, the integrals associated with this geometry drop out after IBP reduction of the full integrand in $D$-dimensions and do not contribute to the final result.
